  "details": "**Problem**: The default scale of `(100, 100 , 1)` does not line up with Unity grid, and shows the lines at a meaningless arbitrary interval.\n\n**Cause**: This is due to the default GridFloor_udon material has a tiling of 8 by 8.\n\n**Solution**: Rescale the Floor object to `(64, 64, 1)` will line up the texture with Unity grid perfectly.",
